# Major Issues in Educational Research: The Kenya Experience.

**Authors:** Mwiria, Kilemi

## Abstract
Analyzes Kenyan educational research conducted over the past 25 years. Examines choice of research topics, research methodologies, training of researchers, funding, and research utilization. Advocates more action and participatory research, greater regional cooperation and coordination, publishing findings in accessible sources, and greater government support to reduce dependence on donor agencies. (CH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ420729

